      <activity id="2903299a-d03f-5b2e-97d4-38b33898f9b8" activityNameId="68af137e-c230-5047-89f3-f07930d8f389" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fittings, door, outer, aluminium, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fittings, door, outer, aluminium, at plant
The weight of individual components and the shares of different materials in each of them were estimated by Wicona and verified by SZFF. Material processing modelled by generic datasets because primary data were not available. Transports estimated by default distances from Frischknecht et al. (2007).;
UUID: e93f8fae-a3a2-37d9-8e09-40efc42018ca
Included are the materials used in components of fittings for outer doors and their transport and processing.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimates by Wicona, verification by SZFF. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e93f8fae-a3a2-37d9-8e09-40efc42018ca.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
